1/simple_description_i18n/jp","突撃方向転換時、敵にダメージを与え、敵のダメージをDOWNさせる"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","特弥希娅冲锋掉转方向时，使“晨曦”抬起后蹄对一名敌人踢击，造成150% + 15% ATK伤害和打断效果，并使其造成伤害降低15%，持续5秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","テミシアが突撃方向を変える時に、「暁」が後ろ足で敵1体を蹴り、150% + 15% ATKのダメージと中断効果を与える。さらに5秒間、対象の与ダメージ-15%"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":48,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"keyword:interrupteff"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":51,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"keyword:interrupteff"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","特弥希娅冲锋掉转方向时，还会使自身回复10%的已损失生命值。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","テミシアが突撃方向転換時、HP減少量×10%を回復"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至160% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが160% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至170% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが170% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_ty